@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 003 搶答作答與結果：組件圖（概念層）

actor 老師
actor 學生
component "老師端畫面\n（作答狀況看板）" as TeacherUI
component "學生端畫面\n（作答區／結果區）" as StudentUI

package "搶答系統（伺服器）" {
  component "作答受理\n(Submission Intake)" as Intake
  component "作廢受理\n(Void Intake)" as VoidIntake
  component "順位判定\n(Ranking)" as Rank
  component "可見範圍過濾\n(Visibility Filter)" as Filter
  component "作答狀況彙整\n(Board Builder)" as Board
  component "結果彙整\n(Result Builder)" as Result
  component "狀態同步（001）\n＋作答定向送出" as Sync
  component "活動階段管理（001）" as Phase
  component "題目庫（002）" as Bank
  database "活動資料儲存\n＋作答 revision counter" as Store
}

學生 --> StudentUI
老師 --> TeacherUI
StudentUI --> Intake : answer:submit（題號與答案，不帶 groupId）
TeacherUI --> VoidIntake : answer:void（groupId、題號）
Intake --> Phase : 檢查階段為搶答中
VoidIntake --> Phase : 檢查階段為搶答中
Intake --> Bank : 檢查題號與空格
VoidIntake --> Bank : 檢查題號與組別作答
Intake --> Store : 同步 transaction 保存 rank 與 counter
VoidIntake --> Store : 同步 transaction 標記作廢與 counter
Intake --> Rank : 有效作答
VoidIntake --> Rank : 作廢後有效作答
Rank --> Board : 各題 rank 與有效作答的最小 rank
Rank --> Result : 各題搶答成功
Board --> Filter
Result --> Filter
Filter --> Sync : 依身分、階段與作答 revision 決定內容
Sync --> TeacherUI : 作答事件：定向送完整看板
Sync --> StudentUI : 作答事件：只送相關組；結束時送結果

note bottom of Filter
  搶答中：學生只收到自己組的資料與 revision
  已結束：學生收到結果與自己組的順位
  老師：收到完整資料與 answerEventCount 形成的 revision
end note

note right of Sync
  作答與作廢不增加 activity.revision
  不送 state 給其他組與 guest
  既有階段／題目變更仍全域送 state
end note
@enduml
